'''Oil''' is a cooking ingredient made from the [[Oil Maker]]. It can also be obtained from [[Pierre's General Store]] for {{Price|200}}. [[Pierre]] sells Oil in his [[Desert Festival#Villager Shops|shop]] at the [[Desert Festival]] for {{Price|4|Calico}} [[Calico Egg]]s. 2-4 Oil may occasionally be found in [[Supply Crate]]s on the [[Farm Maps#Beach|Beach Farm]] provided the player has upgraded the [[Farmhouse]] at least once.

Oil is given no quality rating, so its sell price doesn't benefit from quality increases. It also does not benefit from the [[Skills#Farming|Artisan Profession]]. Its main benefit lies in its use as a [[cooking]] ingredient. Oil made from base quality [[sunflower]]s, grown [[Sunflower Seeds|sunflower seeds]], and gold or lower qualities of [[corn]] is profitable, though corn is more profitable in the [[Keg]], [[Preserves Jar]], or [[Seed Maker]].

==Processing Times==
Note:  From 2am to 6am, machines process at 100 minutes per hour. For the rest of the day, machines process at 60 minutes per hour.
